## 3. `/coding_agent` review

Ran the coding agent review against the landing page:

**Verification:** The app serves correctly at `http://localhost:3456` with the expected "Hari AI IDE is awesome" content.

**One small visual enhancement suggestion:** Add a subtle **typing cursor blink** after the headline — a thin vertical bar (`|`) that pulses at the end of "is awesome", mimicking an IDE cursor. It would reinforce the AI IDE theme without changing the layout. Example CSS:

```css
h1::after {
  content: "|";
  display: inline-block;
  margin-left: 0.1em;
  color: #22d3ee;
  animation: cursorBlink 1s step-end infinite;
}
@keyframes cursorBlink {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: 0; }
}
```

